[13.214292, "o", "# Plan for DEMO-1\r\n## (code_implementation) Implement production-ready code\r\n- **Step 1:** Ensure the code is clean, well-documented, and follows best practices.\r\n- **Step 2:** Test the code thoroughly to ensure it works as expected.\r\n- **Step 3:** Document the code to make it easier to maintain and understand.\r\n\r\n## (data_architect) Designs data schemas, DDL, models, and related artifacts\r\n- **Step 1:** Create a data schema for the service.\r\n- **Step 2:** Design the database schema using a database management tool.\r\n- **Step 3:** Create the database tables and relationships.\r\n- **Step 4:** Write the SQL DDL to create the tables and relationships.\r\n- **Step 5:** Document the database schema to make it easier to maintain and understand.\r\n\r\n## (deployment) Prepares deployment artifacts and handles publishing\r\n- **Step 1:** Create deployment artifacts for the service.\r\n- **Step 2:** Deploy the service to a production environment.\r\n- **Step 3:** Document the deployment process to make it easier to manage and track.\r\n\r\n## (documentation) Creates professional reference documentation\r\n- **Step 1:** Create a documentation directory for the service.\r\n----- PR draft -----\r\n"]
